      "value": "I noticed this as well - I was running the open beta just fine on Sunday, then today after open beta updated, VRChat consistently crashed with Proton Experimental, Proton Experimental Bleeding Edge, and Glorious Eggroll Proton 9-7.\n\nThe default VRChat home world would load juuust enough to be visible, then VRChat crashes and the crash reporter triggers.\n\n(Thankfully, VRChat stable works just fine, and I've been able to attend the first night of Furality with only mild media streaming issues.)\n\nAMD CPU and GPU, Kubuntu 22.04 LTS",
