  "details": "Description of the Issue:\n\nAfter logging into VRChat, a small window appears with the title \"VRChat Unity 2022.3.22f1-DWRL_25d47db03aec\" and a loading bar. Once the loading bar completes, VRChat closes itself without any error message or further action. This issue prevents me from accessing VRChat.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1. Launch VRChat.\n\n2. Log in with your credentials.\n\n3. Observe the appearance of a small window titled \"VRChat Unity 2022.3.22f1-DWRL_25d47db03aec\" with a loading bar.\n\n4. Wait for the loading bar to complete.\n\n5. VRChat closes itself automatically.\n\nAdditional Notes:\n\n- I am running VRChat on Proton Experimental.\n\n- Please let me know if any further information is needed or if some specific logs or details would help diagnose this issue.\n\n- I can not access the QM, the build number is the Build ID in the updates tab in Steam",
